  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-工具\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于修改千川调控任务的设置，包括任务名称、预算、ROI目标等。需要先通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】文档。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.control_task.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/ad/control_task/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1848759062499338\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"qianchuan.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用该接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"该接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1848759062499338\",\"title\":\"修改调控任务设置\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-h4e9C4ue\">修改调控任务设置</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1842410336925451%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%2221knI%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-OLB2VXZp\" id=\"h346b9f0-OLB2VXZp\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Go5AuK15\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/ad/control_task/update/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1848759062499338\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-GGZ465hP\" id=\"h346b9f0-GGZ465hP\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-TJokLjm8\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-83QRNZre\" id=\"h346b9f0-83QRNZre\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cPyBBwfK\" id=\"h346b9f0-cPyBBwfK\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">客户id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">task_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">调控任务ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">调控任务名称</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eMfwpKaX\">预算，单位元，最多支持两位小数</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">roi2_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZID3l1F2\">直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-支付ROI目标，单位元，最多支持两位小数</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-YZujnA6z\">注意：当直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-支付ROI目标</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-fIpm6u4h\">时支持且生效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-P9QUlA1e\">素材列表，需要追投的素材ids\n注意：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-aUnCBRDm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ChzLTb7b\">最多支持20个素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ABrtCo3D\">仅支持视频素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ta4xy2rR\">当scene=MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">duration</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HfLc3UpT\">调控时长，0.5h～24.0h，步进0.5h</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Dv89uZ63\">注意：当ad_id为直播全域控成本计划&amp;scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>时，不支持设置调控时长，默认是长期有效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OCHozl3q\">直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-直播间成交的转化出价，出价不能大于预算</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PLcxsKm6\">注意：当直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-直播间成交时支持且生效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">定向人群设置<p data-id=\"p838747a-A8jpFaWa\">注意：仅支持直播全域素材追投-控成本追投</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">gender</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">性别 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-fRETXTPQ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AbF5VkRB\"><code>GENDER_FEMALE</code>女性 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Of5LPXHf\"><code>GENDER_MALE</code>男性 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-S5b6XiLX\"><code>NONE</code>不限（默认） </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">age</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">年龄 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-1fPY3AVS\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QW5lEeaG\"><code>AGE_ABOVE_50</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gM01oQEJ\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_18_23</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2JSKO7P5\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_24_30</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1LWeSCF2\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_31_40</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FcDKFYK7\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_41_49</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_behaviors</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音用户行为类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-cA9fQJJ4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9VNgDrj7\"><code>COMMENTED_USER</code> 评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lfEQ4Mbo\"><code>FOLLOWED_USER</code> 关注</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-O2d4Jb30\"><code>GOODS_CARTS_CLICK</code> 购物车点击</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Nw4hJ7pw\"><code>GOODS_CARTS_ORDER</code> 购物车下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SvjmNkGS\"><code>LIKED_USER</code> 点赞</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yXDwd1lZ\"><code>LIVE_COMMENT</code> 直播评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ma1t3lIF\"><code>LIVE_EFFECTIVE_WATCH</code> 直播有效观看</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zeOVCDEw\"><code>LIVE_EXCEPTIONAL</code> 直播打赏</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UlZ2ZZkF\"><code>LIVE_GOODS_CLICK</code> 直播商品点击</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Qx8LLWoZ\"><code>LIVE_GOODS_ORDER</code> 直播商品下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T7Q1D4CK\"><code>LIVE_WATCH</code> 直播观看</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3icL1bvG\"><code>SHARED_USER</code> 分享</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_behaviors_days</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人互动用户行为天数 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lkXnaoh1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-c2VKrqOs\"><code>DAYS_15</code>近15天 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ySCfqWfK\"><code>DAYS_30</code>近30天 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ag1sQQr3\"><code>DAYS_60</code>近60天 </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_categories</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人分类ID列表</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_accounts</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人ID列表</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">district_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\">定向or排除地域，允许值：<p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3g3zyjbkwdy00\"> true：排除地域</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-92vgsiq5tws00\"> false：定向地域，默认</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">location_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">地域定向的用户状态类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-fZP5MFSi\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3mt7DEp5\"><code>ALL</code>该地区内的所有用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-N6I0az5A\"><code>CURRENT</code>正在该地区的用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-C3xsShDY\"><code>HOME</code>居住在该地区的用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vcmsKs0x\"><code>TRAVEL</code>到该地区旅行的用户 </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">district</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">地域类型，配合 city 字段使用 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Dm5nZadM\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3WBKmeD8\"><code>CITY</code> 省市</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-egEzKwE5\"><code>COUNTY</code> 区县</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HmCwj4Ne\"><code>NONE</code> 不限</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">city</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">具体定向的城市列表</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-rHjtBxk3\" id=\"h346b9f0-rHjtBxk3\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20i